臥床または重度の障害がある人がいる場合、加入先の医療保険部門へ長期介護保険を申請してください。これは高齢者だけに支給されるものではありません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"家族内に長期臥床の人がいる場合、褥瘡（床ずれ）を最大の敵と見なしましょう：電動エアマットレスの使用、定期的な体位変換、毎日、骨の突出部をチェックする"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"高齢者の白内障が視界に影響しているなら、眼科で手術の検討を。両目に症状がある場合は、二枚目の手術をあまり遅らせないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"高齢者の犬の散歩ではリードを手に巻かず手のひらで握り、短く保つ。引っ張って飛び出さないよう犬を訓練する"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/17"},"children":["第17章"," ·"," ","家族に高齢者がいる場合"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"17-04"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["04"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["高齢者がいつでも使える、断るためのフレーズ：「家族と相談させてください」"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["勧誘や詐欺は、その場の圧力で考える前に払わせようとします。感情が高ぶると誇張広告を信じやすく、高齢者は若い人より説得されやすい傾向があります。「家に帰って家族と相談します」と事前に約束しておけば、いつでも口にでき、その場を離れて落ち着いてから決められます。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。高齢者と一度話し合うだけで、数分で済みます"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["勧誘や詐欺はその場で圧力をかけます。米国連邦取引委員会の指針は、詐欺師が考える前に行動させ、電話を切らせず確認を妨げると説明しています。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：高齢者がいつでも使える、断るためのフレーズ：「家族と相談させてください」"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。高齢者と一度話し合うだけで、数分で済みます"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["勧誘や詐欺はその場で圧力をかけます。米国連邦取引委員会の指針は、詐欺師が考える前に行動させ、電話を切らせず確認を妨げると説明しています。対策は、何をするにもまず友人・家族・隣人などに話すこと。口にすることで詐欺と気づくかもしれません。中国の旧銀行保険監督管理委員会も2021年、金融商品購入前に家族へ相談するよう高齢者に勧めています。実験では65〜85歳116人と30〜40歳115人を集め、勝ち負けのあるゲームで一部の感情を高ぶらせてから誇張・虚偽広告を見せました。感情が実際に高ぶった人は商品を買いたがり、高ぶりの有無にかかわらず高齢者のほうが購入意欲が強くなりました。著者は感情が静まってから支出を決めるよう勧めています。別の実験は以前郵便詐欺で被害を受けた人、主に高齢者が対象でした。事前警告のない人は模擬の詐欺勧誘電話に半数近くが即答で応じましたが、2〜4週間前に電話で注意を促された人では明確に少なくなりました。「帰って家族と相談します」と事前に決めることは、その場で決めずに済む言い訳になります。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Federal Trade Commission (2023). How To Avoid a Scam. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/how-avoid-scam","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/how-avoid-scam"]},"；中国银保监会消费者权益保护局 (2021). 关于警惕「投资养老」「以房养老」金融诈骗的风险提示（2021 年第三期）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://dfjrjgj.hunan.gov.cn/dfjrjgj/yhlj/202106/t20210608_19450856.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://dfjrjgj.hunan.gov.cn/dfjrjgj/yhlj/202106/t20210608_19450856.html"]},"（湖南省地方金融监督管理局转载）；Kircanski K, Notthoff N, DeLiema M, et al. (2018). Emotional arousal may increase susceptibility to fraud in older and younger adults. Psychology and Aging, 33(2), 325-337. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/pag0000228","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1037/pag0000228"]},"；Scheibe S, Notthoff N, Menkin J, et al. (2014). Forewarning reduces fraud susceptibility in vulnerable consumers. Basic and Applied Social Psychology, 36(3), 272-279. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1080/01973533.2014.903844","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1080/01973533.2014.903844"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/how-avoid-scam","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["2つの実験はこの言葉自体を検証していないためBです。一方は感情が高ぶった時の購入意欲、他方は事前警告の効果であり、この言葉を用意した高齢者の詐欺被害がどれだけ減るかは調べていません。第3条（高齢者のお金を別口座に）と併用してください。家の転倒予防も第1節を参考に。この言葉は高齢者がその場で強く拒否せずに離れるためのもので、本人を警戒するためではありません。勧誘する人に囲まれた時は、真偽の判断より人前で断るほうが難しいことがあります。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/17-03"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"高齢者の資金は別口座で管理し、高額支出には二人確認のルールを設ける"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/17-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"高齢者に先払いを求める「投資型老後プラン」には一切手を出さないこと：カード作成、ベッド確保、介護マンション、移住型老後生活、高齢者向け製品の購入は、すべて同一の違法集金の手口です"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-01"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高齢なうちに、将来の後見人を書面で指定しておく"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["意識がはっきりしているうちに、数百元をかけて公証役場へ行き、将来誰が後見人になるかを明記した書面を作成しておきましょう。この書面がないと、…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-02"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["遺言を作成しましょう。後から作成したものが前のものを覆すため、公証遺言が優先されるとは限りません"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["法律は6種類の遺言を認めていますが、形式を間違えると書面全体が無効になります。これが最もよくある失敗です。自筆によるものは、本人が最初から…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["保険会社による住宅リバースモーゲージ型年金保険を除き、他の「自宅を活用した老後プラン」には一切手を出さないこと。絶対に住宅を担保に理財商品を買ってはいけない"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["正規の住宅を活用した老後プランは、保険会社による住宅リバースモーゲージ型年金保険（現在、試験運用中）のただ一種のみです。訪問販売されるもの…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["家族内に長期臥床または重度の障害がある人がいる場合、加入先の医療保険部門へ長期介護保険を申請してください。これは高齢者だけに支給されるものではありません"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["長期介護保険は、介護を依頼するための費用を補助してくれます。家族に重度の障害があり、半年以上継続している場合は、加入先の医療保険部門へ申請…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["家族内に長期臥床の人がいる場合、褥瘡（床ずれ）を最大の敵と見なしましょう：電動エアマットレスの使用、定期的な体位変換、毎日、骨の突出部をチェックする"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["股関節骨折の手術前に褥瘡がある高齢者は、30 日以内に亡くなる可能性が約2割高まります。電動エアマットレスに交換することで、新しい褥瘡がで…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高齢者の白内障が視界に影響しているなら、眼科で手術の検討を。両目に症状がある場合は、二枚目の手術をあまり遅らせないこと"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["70 歳以上の女性が、できるだけ早く片目の白内障手術を受けると、一年間の転倒回数が約3割4減少し、骨折する人も減少します。ただし、転倒した…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/ja/book/17"},"children":["テーマ全体を読む：家族に高齢者がいる場合"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["本"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/ja/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","stroke